 questions+='</fieldset>'
 return f'''<section class="hero frame business-hero"><div class="hero-heading"><p class="index-label">BUILD. OPTIMIZE. GROW.</p><h1>Your business<br>is good.<br><em>Is your digital<br>presence?</em></h1><p class="business-intro">{E(BUSINESS['description'])}</p><div class="business-actions"><a class="business-button" href="#presence-score">Review your digital presence ↗</a><a class="business-link" href="#packages">Explore the packages</a></div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/assets/group/vitaflex-business-group.png" width="1024" height="1024" alt="VitaFlex Business Group — gold VF emblem inside a circular gold border" fetchpriority="high"></div></section>
 <section class="frame business-section" id="presence"><p class="index-label">THE DIGITAL PRESENCE GAP</p><h2>A good business deserves<br><em>a clearer path to its customers.</em></h2><p class="business-lead">Your website, search presence, social profiles and enquiry process should work together. When they do not, customers can struggle to find you, understand you or take the next step.</p><div class="business-grid"><article><span class="index-label">01 — DISCOVERY</span><h3>Can people find you?</h3><p>Missing or inconsistent information can make your business harder to discover.</p></article><article><span class="index-label">02 — CREDIBILITY</span><h3>Do they understand you?</h3><p>Unclear offers and outdated pages can make it difficult to decide whether you are the right fit.</p></article><article><span class="index-label">03 — ACTION</span><h3>Can they take the next step?</h3><p>A confusing mobile experience or broken contact route can interrupt a customer's enquiry.</p></article></div></section>
 <section class="frame business-section" id="presence-score"><p class="index-label">DIGITAL PRESENCE SCORE · GUIDED SELF-ASSESSMENT</p><h2>Start with what<br><em>you actually know.</em></h2><p class="business-lead">Review ten practical signals across Google, your website, social presence and customer conversion.</p><div class="business-notice"><strong>This is a self-assessment, not an automated business audit.</strong><p>We do not scan Google, verify your business or inspect your accounts. Results reflect only your answers. Unknown information is excluded, never scored as a failure. No information is sent or stored by this tool.</p></div><form id="presence-form"><fieldset disabled data-business-controls aria-label="Self-assessment questions">{questions}<button class="business-button" type="submit">Calculate my self-assessment ↗</button></fieldset></form><noscript><p>This interactive self-assessment needs JavaScript. You can still review the questions above and <a href="/business-contact/">discuss your priorities by email</a>.</p></noscript><section id="presence-results" class="business-results" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="score-heading"><h3 id="score-heading">Your self-assessment</h3><p id="score-value" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="score-coverage"></p><div id="score-evidence"></div><p>No score or opportunity here is independently verified. A higher score does not guarantee customers, rankings or revenue.</p><a href="#packages" class="business-button">Explore a suitable next step ↗</a> <a href="/business-contact/" class="business-link">Discuss these findings</a></section></section>
 <section class="frame business-section" id="method"><p class="index-label">THE VITAFLEX GROWTH SYSTEM</p><h2>Not disconnected activity.<br><em>A purposeful system.</em></h2><div class="business-grid method-grid"><article><span class="index-label">01 — BUILD</span><h3>Build the presence.</h3><p>Clarify your offer and create a credible digital foundation.</p></article><article><span class="index-label">02 — ATTRACT</span><h3>Attract the customer.</h3><p>Make your business easier to discover and understand.</p></article><article><span class="index-label">03 — OPTIMIZE</span><h3>Optimize the business.</h3><p>Review customer pathways and focus on meaningful improvements.</p></article><article><span class="index-label">04 — GROW</span><h3>Grow the revenue.</h3><p>Work toward sustainable business growth, with priorities informed by evidence—not promises of guaranteed results.</p></article></div></section>
 <section class="frame business-section" id="packages"><p class="index-label">PACKAGES &amp; PARTNERSHIPS</p><h2>The right next step.<br><em>Not more noise.</em></h2><p class="business-lead">Choose a starting point for a conversation. Deliverables, responsibilities and scope are confirmed in writing before engagement.</p><div class="package-grid">{cards}</div><p class="business-notice">Advertising expenditure is separate from management fees. Revenue, rankings, followers and customer acquisition are not guaranteed. Specific package deliverables must be agreed before purchase; no checkout or payment is taken on this website.</p></section>
 <section class="frame business-section" id="about"><p class="index-label">ABOUT VITAFLEX BUSINESS GROUP</p><h2>A digital-presence<br><em>and business-growth partner.</em></h2><p class="business-lead">We connect the way a business is found, the way it presents itself and the way customers take action. The focus is a stronger digital presence and practical, ongoing business priorities—not just a website or a stream of social posts.</p><a class="business-link" href="/sony/">Meet Sony Alexis ↗</a></section>
 <section class="frame business-section"><p class="index-label">OUR INDEPENDENT VENTURES</p><h2>A wider vision.</h2><p>Explore the existing independent ventures. Their availability remains as described on each venture page.</p></section>{portfolio}
 <section class="frame business-section business-final" id="business-contact"><p class="index-label">BUILD. OPTIMIZE. GROW.</p><h2>Build the presence.<br>Move forward <em>with purpose.</em></h2><p>Tell us about your business and the next thing you want to improve.</p><a class="business-button" href="/business-contact/">Start the conversation ↗</a><a class="business-link" href="mailto:{BUSINESS['contactEmail']}">{BUSINESS['contactEmail']}</a></section>'''
