 return f'''<section class="frame business-section"><p class="index-label">VITAFLEX BUSINESS GROUP · LET'S TALK</p><h1>A stronger presence.<br><em>A practical next step.</em></h1><p class="business-lead">Tell us what your business does and what you would like to improve. We will discuss scope before any engagement.</p><a class="business-link" href="mailto:{BUSINESS['contactEmail']}">{BUSINESS['contactEmail']}</a><form id="business-enquiry"><fieldset disabled data-business-controls aria-label="Email draft details"><label for="business-name">Business name</label><input id="business-name" name="business" maxlength="120" required autocomplete="organization"><label for="business-email">Your email</label><input id="business-email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="200" required autocomplete="email"><label for="business-interest">What would you like to discuss?</label><select id="business-interest" name="interest"><option>Digital presence review</option>{''.join('<option>'+E(p['name'])+'</option>' for p in BUSINESS['packages'])}</select><label for="business-message">Your priorities</label><textarea id="business-message" name="message" rows="6" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="A brief overview is enough. Do not include passwords, financial records or confidential customer information."></textarea><p class="business-notice">This form prepares an email in your email app. It does not submit to a server, create a customer account or send automatically. You must review and send the email yourself. If your email app does not open, use the address above.</p><button type="submit" class="business-button">Prepare my email ↗</button><p id="business-enquiry-status" role="status"></p></fieldset></form><noscript><p>JavaScript is off. Please use the email link above.</p></noscript><a class="business-link" href="/#packages">Review packages ↗</a></section>'''
